; Export forwarding table for the ARM64 native side of MoqiTextServiceARM64X.dll.
; On ARM64 Windows, System32\MoqiTextService.dll is an ARM64X forwarder DLL:
; ARM64 native processes get forwarded to MoqiTextServiceARM64.dll, while x64
; emulation processes get forwarded to MoqiTextServiceX64.dll (see
; MoqiTextService_x64.def). Only the forwarder itself is registered with the
; native ARM64 regsvr32.exe.

EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject = MoqiTextServiceARM64.dll.DllGetClassObject
    DllCanUnloadNow   = MoqiTextServiceARM64.dll.DllCanUnloadNow
    DllRegisterServer = MoqiTextServiceARM64.dll.DllRegisterServer
    DllUnregisterServer = MoqiTextServiceARM64.dll.DllUnregisterServer
